 # Decisions
 
 Product questions settled without asking (format in CONTRIBUTING.md).
+
+DECISION[D1]: the amount paid for the goods (after the coupon, plus tax) is shared over the units in proportion to the unit price, largest remainder first, so the refunds of one order add up to exactly what was paid, whatever the return order (the policy says "what the customer paid for the items" but not how a coupon or the tax splits over several items).
